# Drama Studio mini-app — assets the Worker must NEVER upload.
#
# mini-app/ui is the whole assets directory (worker/wrangler.toml [assets]
# directory = "../ui"), so anything here would otherwise be deployed into the
# bundle and, before this unit, be reachable on the client's studio domain as
# https://<studio>/checks/run-all.sh and friends. The service now also refuses
# every path outside its allow-list (service/src/index.js staticAssetPath);
# this file is the second lock, so the bytes never leave the machine.
#
# gitignore-style patterns, relative to mini-app/ui.
checks/
admin/test/
admin/prove/
upload/fragment-check.mjs
package.json
README.md
